From 5f2c5158c929afc499739111f789e0ef8aba5eac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chandan <chandan@example.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 11:16:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(analytics): build operator-focused Analytics dashboard

- Add AnalyticsDataService with signals for date-range (today/7d/30d/quarter)
  and department filters, driving KPIs, trend, status breakdown, TAT, top
  tests and top referring doctors.
- Replace Analytics placeholder with a full operator dashboard: KPI strip
  with sparklines, revenue/volume trend (ApexCharts area), sample status
  donut with interactive legend, department TAT bars with target markers
  and over-target flags, top tests and top referring doctors tables.
- Responsive layout (5/3/2/1 col KPI grid, stacked charts <1180px).
- Distinctive hover/active language reused from the sidebar: indigo hover
  wash + teal active glow on range/department chips, left accent bar on
  table row hover, lift + shadow on KPI card hover.
---
